{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220800","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220800","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322080001:1":{"text":"その、花冠……それはどこで手に入れたの？","source_cn":"这花环……这花环是你们从哪里拿到的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4B8B6A7CADFB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:1::2":{"text":"花冠","source_cn":"花环","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4914AF0F181E0860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322080002:0":{"text":"あ、あなたたちは、グレイヴボーン……？ああ、デューラ様……アイリーナ、お母さんの後ろへ来なさい……","source_cn":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD710C0B6D3C3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322080002":{"text":"あ、あなたたちは、グレイヴボーン……？ああ、デューラ様……アイリーナ、お母さんの後ろへ来なさい……","source_cn":"你……你们是亡灵……？艾雅在上……艾琳娜，快过来站在我身后……别离她太近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD710C0B6D3C3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322080003:0":{"text":"修道者から聞いてるわ、夫も同じことを言ってたけど……実際にグレイヴボーンと会うのは初めてだから、うちの子を怖がらせたくないの……","source_cn":"修士宣传过这件事，我丈夫也这么说，可我还从没和亡灵打过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD2FF0FE8D9D728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_ti