,"say:9:1322080008:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃんが作ってくれたのよ！お母さんだってこんな綺麗に作れないのに、あのお兄ちゃん、あっという間に編んでくれたの！","source_cn":"——是一个小哥哥给我做的！妈妈都不会编这么漂亮的花环呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3EA65166F2948F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322080009:0":{"text":"痩せてて、肌は真っ白だったわ。それに、体中に包帯を巻いてて……","source_cn":"那孩子瘦瘦的，肤色看着惨白，还裹着一身绷带……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC3B8B78E55B52B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322080010:0":{"text":"あらっ！もしかしてその子が息子さん？どうりで町で見かけたことがないと思ったのよ！","source_cn":"哎呀！莫非那男孩是你儿子？我就说怎么从没在镇子里见过他呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C114345DA95CBD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322080011:1":{"text":"包帯を巻いた、痩せている男の子……間違いないわ、ダイモンよ！","source_cn":"裹着绷带，瘦瘦的……没错，那是戴蒙，就是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D469B930F1398EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1322080011":{"text":"包帯を巻いた、痩せている男の子……間違いないわ、ダイモンよ！","source_cn":"裹着绷带，瘦瘦的……没错，那是戴蒙，就是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D469B930F1398EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322080012:1":{"tex